{"skill":{"slug":"product-marketing-context","displayName":"Product Marketing Context"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770924940180,"changelog":"- Initial release of the product-marketing-context skill.\n- Guides users through creating or updating a comprehensive product marketing context document.\n- Supports both auto-drafting from codebase or manual conversational setup.\n- Captures key sections: product overview, target audience, personas, pain points, competition, differentiation, objections, switching dynamics, customer language, brand voice, proof points, and goals.\n- Outputs a structured `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` used by other marketing skills.\n- Built-in workflow encourages validation, verbatim customer language, and efficient updates.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7132,"sha256":"32ab77572d110c14e2dc6143f3a3a1fe88bf86824aefdfaa2f0a79914064d394","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1912,"sha256":"d7e1f8eae90effddf7ef20dce6147c73e85446cde27937f84081b4af2a5d515f","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789063854808,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"59867e52ec4bac2135cb2226f07a17680866d1bfd536109f6555c83a292336ee","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/59867e52ec4bac2135cb2226f07a17680866d1bfd536109f6555c83a292336ee","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: product-marketing-context\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is classified as suspicious due to broad instructions for file system access. The `SKILL.md` instructs the AI agent to 'study the repo' and 'Read the codebase: README, landing pages, marketing copy, about pages, meta descriptions, package.json, any existing docs' to auto-draft a marketing document. While the stated purpose is benign (creating a local markdown file), the phrase 'study the repo' and 'any existing docs' grants the agent overly broad read access to potentially sensitive files within the project directory (e.g., `.env` files, configuration files, or even private keys if present), creating a significant vulnerability for unintended information disclosure. There is no explicit evidence of malicious intent like exfiltration, but the capability is high-risk.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163539816},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":18,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789063854808},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill creates a reusable product marketing context file from user-provided input or repository marketing materials, and its file access is disclosed and aligned with that purpose.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Repository reading is limited to expected product and marketing sources such as README, landing pages, package metadata, and docs for the auto-draft workflow.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact is a single Markdown skill file with no executable scripts, dependencies, remote retrieval, or install-time commands.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The activation terms include broad marketing phrases like `positioning` and `set up context`, but the runtime workflow asks the user to choose an auto-draft or scratch path and presents the draft before saving.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill persists a shared context file under `.claude/`, but this is clearly disclosed in the description and body and is the main purpose of the skill.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's stated purpose is to create and maintain `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for other marketing skills, and its instructions consistently support that workflow.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that the skill may read product and marketing files in the current repository to draft context and will create or update `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`; review the generated document before allowing it to be saved because other marketing skills may reuse it later.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The trigger language is somewhat broad, but it is marketing-context related and does not by itself cause hidden privileged behavior; the workflow requires user interaction before drafting and saving.\n[SQP-2] expected: Creating `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` is disclosed in the skill description and instructions, and saving occurs after showing the completed document and asking for adjustments.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The supplied SARIF results reported no security findings, which is consistent with the inspected Markdown-only artifact.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789063854808}}}}}